      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Scientific name:</strong> Pimelodella gracilis (Valenciennes, 1835)</li><li><strong>Common names:</strong> Graceful Pimelodella, Schlanker Fadenwels (Germany)</li><li><strong>Type locality:</strong> Corrientes, Río Paraná, Argentina.</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> 170 mm (6.7 in) SL</li><li><strong>IUCN Red List:</strong> Least Concern (last assessed 2018)</li></ul>"
    },
    {
